\par\par \uc2 Law\par \b \uc2 Anti- \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  movement achieved goal of reversing Roe \u8211\'20\'13 but it is far from done\b0\par\par\uc2 Jessica Glenza \par \uc2 1,135 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 July 2022\par 09:02 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 A total end to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the US is the next goal \u8211\'20\'13 and how the movement aims to accomplish that depends on who you ask\par \par \uc2 The anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  movement has historically been among the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/jun/24/how-americans-lost-federal-abortion-rights"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 best organized factions}}}\uc2  in American politics, and for decades has had a seemingly singular goal: overturn Roe v Wade.\par \par \uc2 Last week, that was accomplished and as the anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  movement celebrated its victory via the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2 , one question has emerged: what will they do next?\par \par \uc2 The court\u8217\'20\'19s conservative supermajority {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/jun/24/roe-v-wade-overturned-abortion-summary-supreme-court"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reversed the landmark 1973 decision}}}\uc2 , which had granted US women the federal right to terminate a pregnancy. The end to the constitutional right almost immediately led more than {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2022/jun/28/tracking-where-abortion-laws-stand-in-every-state"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 half a dozen states}}}\uc2  to ban the procedure. In the coming weeks and months, more than half of US states are expected to institute {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/may/05/abortion-deserts-clinics-access-closed-map"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 severe restrictions or outright bans}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 But that does not mean the end of the movement. Far from it, in fact.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThere still is a singular goal,\u8221\'20\'1D said Mary Ziegler, a historian of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  laws in the US, a visiting law professor at Harvard, and recent author of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nytimes.com/2022/06/12/books/review-dollars-for-life-abortion-mary-ziegler.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dollars for Life: The Anti-\b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Movement and the Fall of the Republican Establishment}}}\uc2 . That goal \u8220\'20\'1Chas never been the overruling of Roe\u8221\'20\'1D but fetal personhood \u8211\'20\'13 a legal concept that would establish \u8220\'20\'1Csome kind of recognition of fetal rights\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Global healthcare groups and human rights advocates have called the US court\u8217\'20\'19s decision {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/global-development/2022/jun/24/worlds-medics-condemn-us-overturn-abortion-rights"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1Can unconscionable attack\u8221\'20\'1D}}}\uc2  on the health and rights of US women and girls, warned it will cause a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/may/14/dr-tlaleng-mofokeng-roe-v-wade-reversal-un"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 global chilling effect}}}\uc2  on reproductive healthcare, and that \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2022/jun/27/roe-wade-forced-birth-america-abortion-ban-misogyny"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 forced birth}}}\uc2  will exacerbate already {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/jun/27/roe-v-wade-overturned-maternal-mortality-rate-will-rise"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 egregious maternal mortality disparities}}}\uc2  in the US.\par \par \uc2 Nevertheless, the anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  movement has made clear its work is not done. But how to set about achieving the next goal \u8211\'20\'13 a total end to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the US \u8211\'20\'13 depends on who you ask.\par \par \uc2 Ruth Bader Ginsburg\uc2 , former liberal supreme court justice and famous supporter of reproductive rights, had argued Roe provided opponents of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/story/2013/05/ruth-bader-ginsburg-roe-v-wade-abortion-091218"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a target to aim at relentlessly}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 With the landmark case no longer an impediment to anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ambitions, \u8220\'20\'1Cthere\u8217\'20\'19s much more of a kind of free-for-all about how you should achieve personhood\u8221\'20\'1D, Ziegler said. Now, the once rigidly cohesive movement is wrestling with the best way forward.\par \par \uc2 In Georgia, where a ban on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  at six weeks gestation is likely to go into effect, anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  leaders immediately called on the Republican governor, Brian Kemp, to impanel to pass a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.augustachronicle.com/story/opinion/2022/06/23/pray-end-roe-v-wade-and-establish-personhood-amendment-georgia-right-life-director/7699245001/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1Cpersonhood\u8221\'20\'1D amendment}}}\uc2  to the state\u8217\'20\'19s constitution.\par \par \uc2 Such a law would imbue fertilized eggs with the rights of people, ban embryo selection for in vitro fertilization, and call into question treatment for ectopic pregnancies (in which an embryo implants outside the uterus and is never viable).\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe are petitioning him to call a special legislative session,\u8221\'20\'1D said Zemmie Fleck, executive director for Georgia Right to Life. \u8220\'20\'1CBrian Kemp says he is pro-life, and if he is truly pro-life, then we\u8217\'20\'19re saying this is your time to protect every innocent human life.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Fleck also opposes {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/society/2022/jun/28/emergency-contraception-pills-pharmacies"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 emergency contraception}}}\uc2  and some forms of birth control, said there should be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/may/06/no-exception-rape-incest-anti-abortion-laws-republicans-us"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 no exemptions}}}\uc2  to allow abortions for rape, incest or fetal abnormalities, and that ectopic pregnancies should be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2019/nov/29/ohio-extreme-abortion-bill-reimplant-ectopic-pregnancy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1Creimplanted\u8221\'20\'1D}}}\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 though no such procedure exists, according to the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.acog.org/advocacy/facts-are-important/understanding-ectopic-pregnancy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 American College of Obstetricians and Gynecologists}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Whether Georgia Right to Life will endorse prosecuting women, Fleck said, is something the group is now actively considering.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe fact someone is intentionally taking a life is a huge consideration, because we have laws in Georgia that pertain to someone who murders someone,\u8221\'20\'1D said Fleck. \u8220\'20\'1CBut again [we] do not have a strict position statement.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 However, anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  campaigners\u8217\'20\'19 strategy in Georgia is just one of many to emerge in the days leading up to and following Roe\u8217\'20\'19s reversal.\par \par \uc2 Former vice-president \uc2 Mike Pence\uc2  called for a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2022/06/24/abortion-supreme-court-trump-pence-republicans-roe/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 national \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  ban}}}\uc2 . The anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  group National Right to Life (NRL) issued {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://webcache.googleusercontent.com/search?q=cache:1imuUnthvTwJ:https://www.nrlc.org/wp-content/uploads/NRLC-Post-Roe-Model-Abortion-Law-FINAL-1.pdf+&cd=1&hl=en&ct=clnk&gl=us"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 model legislation}}}\uc2  to ban \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  except to save a woman\u8217\'20\'19s life. It also suggested states ban \u8220\'20\'1Cgiving instructions over the telephone, internet or any other medium of communication regarding self-administered \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8221\'20\'1D, a suggestion with enormous free speech implications.\par \par \uc2 Anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  leaders in several states called for constitutional amendments to clarify there is no right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , such as in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://gov.alaska.gov/newsroom/2022/06/24/governor-dunleavy-reacts-to-the-u-s-supreme-court-decision-overturning-roe-v-wade/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Alaska}}}\uc2  and Kentucky. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wvgazettemail.com/election_2018/west-virginians-ok-anti-abortion-constitutional-amendment/article_d6d43855-50a7-51e2-9934-2a71db57c55b.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 West Virginia}}}\uc2  pioneered this path before the fall of Roe, and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://kansasreflector.com/2022/06/24/demise-of-roe-v-wade-adds-gravity-to-kansas-vote-on-abortion-constitutional-amendment/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kansas voters}}}\uc2  are already scheduled to cast ballots on a similar measure on 2 August.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the largest US anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  online media site, Live Action, has been furiously fundraising to \u8220\'20\'1Ccut through the lies about what the ending of Roe really means for children, women, and families\u8221\'20\'1D. One email argued treatment for ectopic pregnancy and miscarriage will remain legal, although reproductive rights advocates said access to such procedures is will probably diminish when obstetricians and gynecologists {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/may/06/abortion-bans-patient-doctor-medical-advice"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fear prosecution}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Addia Wuchner, executive director of Kentucky Right to Life, argued assertions that anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  activists want to ban some forms of contraception, in vitro fertilization and \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.vox.com/2019/10/31/20939890/missouri-abortion-clinic-hearing-periods-roe-wade"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 monitor ovulation}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D were not true.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThese are the great lies of an industry \u8211\'20\'13 I know they want to be called a healthcare service \u8211\'20\'13 that has made great profits off the back of women,\u8221\'20\'1D Wuchner said about \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  providers, such as obstetricians and gynecologists.\par \par \uc2 Similarly, Wuchner said concerns about the right to contraception and same-sex marriage being overturned in the courts are \u8220\'20\'1Cblown out of proportion\u8221\'20\'1D. Kentucky right to life is neither working to ensure access to birth control, nor to \u8220\'20\'1Cmake it illegal\u8221\'20\'1D, she said.\par \par \uc2 When the supreme court overturned Roe v Wade, conservative supreme court justice \uc2 Clarence Thomas\uc2  explicitly stated the court should {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/jun/24/clarence-thomas-roe-gay-marriage-contraception-lgbtq"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1Creconsider\u8221\'20\'1D}}}\uc2  cases that established same-sex marriage, same-sex intimacy and the right to contraception. Thomas\u8217\'20\'19s opinion, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nytimes.com/2022/06/24/us/jim-obergefell-same-sex-marriage-rights-roe.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 advocates fear}}}\uc2 , was an invitation for such rights to be challenged.\par \par \uc2 Debates about how to enforce \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans have also emerged. Some progressive prosecutors have made national headlines for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/jun/14/progressive-prosecutors-refuse-abortion-bans-states"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 refusing to enforce \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  bans}}}\uc2 . However, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/nov/29/us-abortion-supreme-court-roe-v-wade"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 conservative local prosecutors}}}\uc2  have also vowed to vigorously investigate alleged \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban violations, such as Benton county, Arkansas, prosecuting attorney Nathan Smith.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19ll approach it like any other potential crime,\u8221\'20\'1D said Smith, who {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.4029tv.com/article/benton-county-prosecutor-says-his-office-will-enforce-arkansas-abortion-ban/40461180#:~:text=ROGERS%2C%20Ark.%20%E2%80%94-,The%20Benton%20County%20Prosecutor%20Nathan%20Smith%20sent%20a%20letter%20to,abortions%2C%20according%20to%20Arkansas%20Law."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sent a letter}}}\uc2  to a local Planned Parenthood affiliate assuring them he would seek criminal charges. \u8220\'20\'1CIf somebody reports an initial violation of the statute, law enforcement will investigate it, and we\u8217\'20\'19ll proceed on a case by case basis like anything else\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 In the chaos that has followed the Dobbs decision, the long-term direction of the movement is difficult to predict, Ziegler said, though one aim remains \u8211\'20\'13 a total ban on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CUltimately, the end goal is the same for everybody,\u8221\'20\'1D Ziegler said.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020220701ei710018i\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
