\par\par \uc2 World news\par \b \uc2 How to support  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  access in a post-Roe America\b0\par\par\uc2 Debasri Ghosh, Rebecca Gomperts, Elizabeth Ling, Nzingha Hall, Robin Marty and Rene Bracey Sherman \par \uc2 2,093 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 June 2022\par 03:22 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 From stocking up on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills to donating to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  funds, rights advocates share ways to support reproductive autonomy\par \par \uc2 With the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  no longer nationally protected in the United States, roughly half of US states are likely to ban the procedure outright. Below, six leaders from the reproductive rights movement share ways to support continued \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access throughout the country.\par \par \uc2 Donate to an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  fund\par \par \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Funds are coordinating travel, food, lodging and more\u8217\'20\'19 \u8211\'20\'13 Debasri Ghosh\par \par \uc2 The supreme court has issued a shattering blow to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights that will have rippling effects felt in every corner of the United States. But help is available from a powerful network of more than 90 \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  funds who are ready to support \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  seekers.\par \par \uc2 For decades, local \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  funds have shown up to help relieve the economic burden for people seeking abortions. Funds assist their communities with navigating injustices like insurance bans on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  care, low wages, a lack of paid time off and unaffordable childcare. As more people are forced to travel for their abortions, funds are coordinating travel, food, lodging and more. From July 2019 to June 2020, \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  funds were able to assist more than 80,000 people with over $11m in funding. That\u8217\'20\'19s only a fraction of the requests received that year. More state \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans will worsen an already dire \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  funding crisis.\par \par \uc2 Donating to your local \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  fund ensures that a person seeking \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a state where it\u8217\'20\'19s illegal can call someone who can help them plan and fund their trip. You\u8217\'20\'19re making sure someone receives them at their destination, with compassion and open arms, with information and support, and gets them back home safe. Whether you\u8217\'20\'19re in a restrictive state or state with fewer restrictions, you\u8217\'20\'19re ensuring a person traveling has anchors of support for them throughout their expensive, exhausting trip. Everyone deserves to feel supported and safe during their \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  experience.\par \par \uc2 So it\u8217\'20\'19s time for a deep investment in \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  funds, wherever you live. Funds need more support if they are to strengthen and sustain their power as this crisis escalates. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://abortionfunds.org/funds"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  A recurring donation to your local \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  fund}}}\uc2  is the best way to show you\u8217\'20\'19re invested in \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access for all.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Debasri Ghosh is the managing director of the National Network of \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  Funds\par \par \uc2 Get \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills \u8211\'20\'13 even if you don\u8217\'20\'19t need them now\par \par \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18 The best response to a backlash against our rights is to retake control\u8217\'20\'19 \u8211\'20\'13Rebecca Gomperts\par \par \uc2 We have always had to plan for our lives and futures. Any plan takes into account risks, possibilities and obstacles. When these change, our plans have to change.\par \par \uc2 Now it is time to change plans again. Instead of relying on easy access to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  when we need one, we now have to take preventive measures. This means making sure we have \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills at home in the event of an unwanted pregnancy in the future.\par \par \uc2 Preventive medicine is common and acceptable in many circumstances \u8211\'20\'13 like when we travel and bring a supply of oral rehydration salts, antibiotics and anti-malaria tablets in case of sickness. Now, we must get \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills for future use, for ourselves or a friend who might need them. \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills have a long shelf live and are safe and effective for years past their original expiration date {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7040264/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 when stored}}}\uc2  in a dry, cool space, away from light.\par \par \uc2 Many women know they might be pregnant already on the day they miss their period \u8211\'20\'13 and even if they are a few weeks late, they can safely use the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills. The \uc2 World Health Organization\uc2  supports home use of the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills up to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apps.who.int/iris/bitstream/handle/10665/332334/WHO-SRH-20.11-eng.pdf?sequence=1&isAllowed=y"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 12 weeks}}}\uc2  of pregnancy. You can get \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills for future use from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.womenonweb.org"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Women on Web}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.aidaccess.org"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Aid Access}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The best response to a backlash against our rights is to retake control. We can do this through proper planning and by obtaining \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills for future use.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Rebecca Gomperts is a Dutch physician and the founder of a number of initiatives, including {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.womenonwaves.org/en/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Women on Waves}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://aidaccess.org/en/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Aid Access}}}\uc2 , which provide reproductive health services to people in countries that restrict them.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 If you\u8217\'20\'19re considering self-managing an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , call the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reprolegalhelpline.org/sma-contact-the-helpline/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Repro Legal Helpline}}}\uc2  at 844-868-2812 to understand your rights.\par \par \uc2 Fight the criminalization of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 More people will manage their own abortions. Help limit the legal risk\par \par \uc2 \u8211\'20\'13Elizabeth Ling\par \par \uc2 As clinic-based care becomes increasingly unavailable, more people will turn to self-managed \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  as a medically safe alternative that affords them dignity and agency over their lives. But self-managed \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not come without legal risk. Real and equitable \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access in this country will never be possible until we end the criminalization of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and other pregnancy outcomes.\par \par \uc2 Over the past few decades, the protections of Roe v Wade have not stopped people from being criminalized for their pregnancy outcomes, from self-managed \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 which is not a crime in 47 states \u8211\'20\'13 to pregnancy loss. Without Roe, \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans, restrictions and surveillance of our reproductive decisions are certain to increase and so will the risk of criminalization. This is especially true for communities who already experience the greatest risk of state violence and over-policing \u8211\'20\'13 Black and Indigenous people, other people of color, young people, immigrants, queer and trans people, disabled people and people living in poverty.\par \par \uc2 To combat criminalization, share accurate information and resources that help people to make the best decisions for themselves. Spread the word about the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reprolegalhelpline.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Repro Legal Helpline}}}\uc2 , a free, secure and confidential resource for anyone who needs legal information about self-managed \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  or youth access to clinical \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . (People experiencing a miscarriage or \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  at home can also get free advice from the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.mahotline.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  M+A hotline}}}\uc2 .) Make sure your loved ones know that there is no law that requires people to say that they took \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills in order to receive medical care.\par \par \uc2 We encourage anyone who believes they will be investigated for ending a pregnancy not to speak to police without a lawyer and to contact the helpline at 844-868-2812.\par \par \uc2 Donate to the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://reprolegaldefensefund.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  Repro Legal Defense Fund}}}\uc2 , which provides bail support and legal fees for anyone arrested for self-managing their \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Now, more than ever, we must all fight against state oppression to ensure that everyone has the right and the resources they need to decide if, when, and how to have a family.\par \par \uc2 Elizabeth Ling is the\par \par \uc2 senior\par \par \uc2 helpline\par \par \uc2 counsel at If/When/How, where she manages the Repro Legal Helpline, assisting people in understanding the laws around a variety of reproductive experiences\par \par \uc2 Support \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  doulas\par \par \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18We are readier than ever to support people seeking \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  care\u8217\'20\'19\par \par \uc2 \u8211\'20\'13 Nzingha Hall\par \par \uc2 As a member of a growing cadre of trained \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  doulas, I realize that our services are about to be more essential than ever. Despite the supreme court ruling, I and other doulas around the world will continue to help folks access the healthcare they deserve.\par \par \uc2 An \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  doula is a support person who assists folks during their \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  procedures. We provide information on what the patient or client can expect before, during, and after their procedure. We help navigate the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  process in a culturally comprehensive, gender-affirming way, whether they are receiving medication or surgical \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  procedures. We can be present in-person or virtually. We can provide emotional support and lodging, and can sometimes assist with funding.\par \par \uc2 We are readier than ever to support people seeking \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  care in a country that does not honor bodily autonomy and reproductive rights. When needed, we will use Facetime, Zoom and other virtual platforms to communicate with folks undergoing the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  process.\par \par \uc2 If you are interested in becoming an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  doula, you can attend a training through an organization like {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.badoulatrainings.org/abortion-doula"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  Birthing Advocacy Doula Trainings}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wearedopo.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  Dopo}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.chicagowomenshealthcenter.org/abortion-companion-training"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Chicago Women\u8217\'20\'19s Health Center}}}\uc2  and the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://mtnabortiondoula.co/get-involved"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Mountain Area \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Collective}}}\uc2 . If you or someone you know would like to access the support of an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  doula, check out {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.spiralmn.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  Spiral Collective}}}\uc2  in Minnesota and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.sistersong.net/directory"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  SisterSong}}}\uc2 , a national reproductive justice collective, for a list of doulas to fit your needs. Contact your local {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://abortionfunds.org/funds/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  fund}}}\uc2  to access information on finding an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  doula that provides services in your area. Support these organizations to ensure \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  doulas can reach the people who need them.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Nzingha Hall is an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  doula and writer based in Atlanta, Georgia\par \par \uc2 Keep red state clinics open\par \par \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Too many people have literally no place else to turn\par \par \uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 \u8211\'20\'13 Robin Marty\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  seekers in the south-east third of the United States are about to face a stark choice. Some will navigate a complex and expensive path to a legal clinic in North Carolina or southern Illinois. Others will use herbs or medicines to bring about a miscarriage \u8211\'20\'13 facing legal risk if their actions are discovered.\par \par \uc2 The deep south already has a healthcare crisis. Approximately half the pregnancies in Alabama and Mississippi are unplanned, and the two states have some of the worst maternal mortality and child mortality rates in the nation. Unfortunately, ending \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the Gulf states won\u8217\'20\'19t just close the only places where someone can safely terminate a pregnancy. It will also close many of the only clinics outside country health departments that provide birth control and sexual healthcare for low-income and uninsured people.\par \par \uc2 There are seven \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  clinics total in the three states that make up the Gulf coast region (Louisiana, Mississippi and Alabama), each one of them an independent provider with no other financial support network to subsidize them once \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is gone. Protecting red state clinics \u8211\'20\'13 even if they no longer are able to offer elective abortions themselves \u8211\'20\'13 is imperative in order to provide the services needed to reduce unwanted pregnancies. We will be the only entities that can provide aftercare and follow-ups for those who can\u8217\'20\'19t go to hospitals or doctors without fear of arrest.\par \par \uc2 We already see \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  patients turned away from ERs \u8211\'20\'13 told to go back to their clinics for follow-up while they\u8217\'20\'19re bleeding on the floor. What will happen when \u8220\'20\'1Ctheir clinic\u8221\'20\'1D is 600 miles away?\par \par \uc2 If we truly believe healthcare is a right then {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=DPSSVPN98ZJQ4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 we must invest in keeping clinics open}}}\uc2 , even in the most extreme of anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  states. Too many people have literally no place else to turn.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Robin Marty is the\par \par \uc2 operations\par \par \uc2 director of West Alabama Women\u8217\'20\'19s Center in Tuscaloosa, Alabama, and the author of\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://smile.amazon.com/New-Handbook-Post-Roe-America-Practical/dp/1644210584/ref=sr_1_1?crid=13CC9D7M306TJ&keywords=handbook+for+a+post-roe+america&qid=1653766500&sprefix=handbook%2Caps%2C119&sr=8-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The New Handbook for a Post-Roe America: The complete guide to \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  legality, access and practical support}}}\par \par \uc2 Combat stigma by sharing your \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  story\par \par \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18They cannot take our voices from us\u8217\'20\'19 \u8211\'20\'13 Renee Bracey Sherman\par \par \uc2 For those of us who have had abortions, the moment we feared and knew would come is actually here, and it is crushing. We know what access to our abortions meant to our lives and our ability to decide if, when, and how to grow our families.\par \par \uc2 My \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  at age 19 meant that I could live my life on my own terms. My mother\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  meant the same for her and made my own life possible.\par \par \uc2 There are many ways to support \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access. You can donate to local \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  funds and independent clinics at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://keepourclinics.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  KeepOurClinics.org}}}\uc2 . You can help {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://wetestify.org/abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 people navigate the system to get abortions}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 You can also help eradicate \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  stigma by sharing your \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  story. No matter what, they cannot take our voices from us, and our stories deserve to be heard. When we share our stories, we challenge the misinformation, stigma and lies being written into law and spread throughout our communities. Our stories let the other one in four people who\u8217\'20\'19ve had abortions know they are not alone, and that terminating a pregnancy is very common.\par \par \uc2 So share #OurAbortionStories on social media, at rallies, and at your dinner tables. Share as much or as little as you feel comfortable putting out into the world. And be ready to listen when someone is ready to share their stories with you.\par \par \uc2 Share your story with us at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://ihadanabortion.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 IHadAnAbortion.org}}}\uc2 . We\u8217\'20\'19re building a space for people who are having abortions to know what they can expect, and for all of us to hear each other\u8217\'20\'19s stories. We\u8217\'20\'19re ready to listen.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Renee Bracey Sherman is the founder and executive director of We Testify, an organization dedicated to the leadership and representation of people who have abortions\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020220626ei6q0008d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
