\par\par \uc2 World news\par \b \uc2 My state just banned  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2 . What are my options?\b0\par\par\uc2 Poppy Noor and Noa Yachot \par \uc2 1,151 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 June 2022\par 09:00 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 How to get financial help and access pills by mail \u8211\'20\'13 and how to protect yourself in this new punitive landscape\par \par \uc2 The supreme court this week overturned Roe v Wade, the 1973 decision that established a constitutional right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  restrictions of varying severity are now set to sweep across many US states, creating a confusing patchwork of rules and dramatically limiting reproductive care in much of the country.\par \par \uc2 Clinics will shutter and conservative lawmakers will work to crack down on remaining avenues for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  care. However, the demise of half-century-old federal protections will not stop people who want abortions from obtaining them. Here, we lay out some of the remaining options for residents of even the most restrictive states.\par \par \uc2 I am seeking an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but my state just banned the procedure. What do I do?\par \par \uc2 First, check the latest on your state. Even if lawmakers have promised to ban the procedure, the timeline for implementing bans will differ by state. You can get an update on where your state stands via {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://states.guttmacher.org/policies/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 this tracker}}}\uc2  from the \uc2 Guttmacher Institute\uc2 , an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access research organization.\par \par \uc2 Travel out of state\par \par \uc2 If your state has banned \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , one option is to travel to a state that allows it. Some state lawmakers have said they want to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/may/03/us-abortions-travel-wave-of-restrictions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 criminalize travel across state lines}}}\uc2  for an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but this hasn\u8217\'20\'19t happened yet.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.abortionfinder.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Finder}}}\uc2  has a comprehensive directory of trusted and verified \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  providers in the US. Using your state and the date of last period, it lists the closest clinics where you can still legally obtain an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , along with procedures the clinic offers and the relevant laws in that state. Pay attention to the restrictions at your destination \u8211\'20\'13 in some states, for example, patients must endure a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.guttmacher.org/state-policy/explore/counseling-and-waiting-periods-abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 waiting period}}}\uc2  between an initial consultation and an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Make sure the clinic you are planning to travel to actually provides abortions \u8211\'20\'13 that may sound obvious, but many \u8220\'20\'1Cpregnancy crisis centers\u8221\'20\'1D appear to be \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  clinics, but don\u8217\'20\'19t actually offer the procedure . That can cause people to lose precious time.\par \par \uc2 Access financial support\par \par \uc2 If you need help paying for an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , childcare, travel or accommodation, contact your local \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  fund. You can find a list of groups through the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://abortionfunds.org/need-abortion/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 National Network of \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Funds.}}}\uc2  Be sure to work out what costs you can cover, if any, before calling.\par \par \uc2 Obtain \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills\par \par \uc2 Medication abortions are an FDA-approved method of managing an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  yourself, up to 10 weeks of pregnancy (though the \uc2 World Health Organization{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.who.int/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 says}}}\uc2  the pills can be used to self-manage \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  up to 12 weeks). The pills are safe \u8211\'20\'13 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ansirh.org/sites/default/files/publications/files/mifepristone_safety_4-23-2019.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  less dangerous than Tylenol}}}\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.kff.org/womens-health-policy/fact-sheet/the-availability-and-use-of-medication-abortion/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 effective in 99.6% of cases.}}}\uc2  In many states, they can be accessed through telehealth. Resources like {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.plancpills.org/states/new-york"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Plan C}}}\uc2  list options for accessing \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills depending on where you live, and reputable services like {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://aidaccess.org/en/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Aid Access}}}\uc2  ship pills from overseas to states where the procedure is restricted. Aid Access will also send you pills to keep on hand even if you\u8217\'20\'19re not pregnant.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill providers also offer vital instructions for taking the medication, and what to do in the event of complications. Be careful: scam sites abound. Plan C has tested the pills from the online pharmacies it lists, but notes that they can\u8217\'20\'19t continually attest to their reliability..\par \par \uc2 Can I be prosecuted for getting an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  if my state has banned the procedure?\par \par \uc2 Self-managed \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is criminalized in three states \u8211\'20\'13 Nevada, Oklahoma and South Carolina \u8211\'20\'13 and exists elsewhere in a sort of legal gray zone. Even in the most restrictive states, anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  laws typically target providers and exempt the pregnant person from criminalization. However, experts warn that could change if conservative lawmakers feel emboldened to pass even harsher laws.\par \par \uc2 The fact that current laws exempt pregnant people, however, does not mean self-managed \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  carries no risks. People in the US {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/apr/09/texas-woman-26-charged-murder-self-induced-abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 have been prosecuted}}}\uc2  for their pregnancy outcomes, including after accessing \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills online, and advocates worry about increased criminalization for self-managed \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  without Roe\u8217\'20\'19s protections. If you\u8217\'20\'19re considering self-managing your \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , or have questions about legal risks associated with ordering pills online, consult the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reprolegalhelpline.org/sma-contact-the-helpline/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Repro Legal Helpline}}}\uc2  at 844-868-2812.\par \par \uc2 What should I do to protect myself?\par \par \uc2 Advocates worry that states that ban \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  will use aggressive measures \u8211\'20\'13 in particular increased digital surveillance \u8211\'20\'13 to investigate people they suspect of having or facilitating abortions. That could mean {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/may/06/abortion-laws-surveillance-privacy-phone-data"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 law enforcement officials accessing troves of digital data}}}\uc2 , including location information, data from period-tracking apps, web browsing history or text and call records.\par \par \uc2 There are several ways law enforcement officials can access data that could ultimately serve as evidence. In addition to subpoenaing companies, law enforcement can buy stockpiles of compromising information from data brokers, which are companies that often collect or buy your information directly from the services you use. We have already seen {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/nov/29/us-abortion-supreme-court-roe-v-wade"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 examples}}}\uc2  of prosecutors using evidence of web searches to criminalize pregnancy loss.\par \par \uc2 Organizations like the Digital Defense Fund and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.eff.org/deeplinks/2022/05/digital-security-and-privacy-tips-those-involved-abortion-access"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Electronic Frontier Foundation}}}\uc2  have resources on things you can do to keep your information private if you\u8217\'20\'19re researching your options or self-managing an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . These include using private, encrypted messaging apps like {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://signal.org/en/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Signal}}}\uc2 , which is free and very easy to use and doesn\u8217\'20\'19t store your messages on company servers, making it harder for law enforcement to access them.\par \par \uc2 Unlike \uc2 Google\uc2 , which saves all your searches, making them relatively easily accessible to police, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://duckduckgo.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DuckDuckGo}}}\uc2  is an alternative search engine that doesn\u8217\'20\'19t save your data. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/browsers/mobile/focus/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 FireFox Focus}}}\uc2  is a web browser with more privacy protections than browsers like Chrome. There are plenty more steps you can take to protect your privacy; {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://digitaldefensefund.org/ddf-guides/abortion-privacy%5C"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 this overview}}}\uc2  from the Digital Defense Fund is worth consulting.\par \par \uc2 What if something goes wrong?\par \par \uc2 Plan C links to free texting and phone services to call in the event of an emergency, including {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.mahotline.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  a hotline for doctors}}}\uc2  experienced in dealing with \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  who will not ask for any identifying information.\par \par \uc2 If you are in urgent need of medical care, seek help from a doctor. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.plannedparenthood.org/learn/abortion/the-abortion-pill/how-safe-is-the-abortion-pill"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 This resource}}}\uc2  from Planned Parenthood, or {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.womenonweb.org/en/page/523/questions-and-answers-about-abortion-pills"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 this one}}}\uc2  from Women on Web, list some of the complications that should prompt you to seek care. Remember that a medical \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is indistinguishable from an unplanned miscarriage \u8211\'20\'13 so if you end up in a hospital for complications, you do not need to tell doctors or any other officials that you have taken pills.\par \par \uc2 If you have a legal question, call the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reprolegalhelpline.org/sma-contact-the-helpline/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Repro Legal Helpline}}}\uc2  at 844-868-2812. They provide free and confidential legal information. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://reprolegaldefensefund.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  Repro Legal Defense Fund}}}\uc2  provides bail support and legal fees for anyone arrested for self-managing their \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nationaladvocatesforpregnantwomen.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 National Advocates for Pregnant Women}}}\uc2  may also offer pro-bono support for anyone facing criminal charges for self-managed \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020220625ei6p0012z\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
